OL,3,GNEWSACathedral organ centenary brings
OL,4,Afamily story home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family connection stretching back
OL,7,Fmore than a century is returning to the
OL,8,Fplace where it all began as organ
OL,9,Fcelebrations continue.
OL,11,FAt Liverpool Cathedral, an exhibition
OL,12,Fmarking 100 years of the Grand Organ
OL,13,Fremains open after a month of events
OL,14,Fcelebrating the instrument's history
OL,15,Fand legacy.
OL,17,FThe largest pipe organ in the UK has
OL,18,Fbeen at the centre of worship and music
OL,19,Fat the cathedral since its dedication
OL,20,Fin 1926 and will be the focus of a
OL,21,Fcentenary recital later.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
