OL,3,GNEWSACathedral organ centenary brings
OL,4,Afamily story home
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Douglas-Goss-Custard is the
OL,7,Fgrandson of the original organist, said
OL,8,F"it [the recital] will be nostalgia. It
OL,9,Fbrings back memories," ahead of his
OL,10,Fvisit to the cathedral.
